class: runtime
profiles: standard
summary: the Benchmark Game regex-redux correctness workload reads FASTA from standard input into a text builder growing on hosted/heap, takes out its header lines and line breaks with core/regex, counts the nine variants and applies the five IUB replacements in turn, printing each variant's count and the three lengths
